 847:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/mbedtls/pk.h ****  * \brief           Make signature given a signature type.
 848:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/mbedtls/pk.h ****  *
 849:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/mbedtls/pk.h ****  * \param pk_type   Signature type.
