 855:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/pkparse.c **** /*
 856:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/pkparse.c ****  * Parse an encrypted PKCS#8 encoded private key
 857:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/pkparse.c ****  *
 858:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/pkparse.c ****  * To save space, the decryption happens in-place on the given key buffer.
 859:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/pkparse.c ****  * Also, while this function may modify the keybuffer, it doesn't own it,
 860:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/pkparse.c ****  * and instead it is the responsibility of the caller to zeroize and properly
 861:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/pkparse.c ****  * free it after use.
